<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>PulseMind AI</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f4f9ff;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0078ff, #00c6ff);
      color: white;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #0078ff;
    }
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    footer {
      background: #0a2540;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    a {
      color: #00c6ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>PulseMind AI</h1>
  <p>Detecting silent health risks before they become illness</p>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>The Problem</h2>
  <p>
    Most health issues start with subtle signals like fatigue, poor sleep,
    emotional numbness, or mental overload. These early warnings often go unnoticed
    until serious illness develops.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>The Solution</h2>
  <p>
    PulseMind AI is a preventive AI platform that listens to weak physical,
    mental, and emotional signals over time to reveal invisible health risks
    before crisis occurs.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Core Features</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="card">Silent Symptom Detector</div>
    <div class="card">Mental Load Index</div>
    <div class="card">Emotional Side-Effect Predictor</div>
    <div class="card">Chronic Day-Quality Tracker</div>
    <div class="card">Health Honesty Reflector</div>
    <div class="card">Health Translator</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>How It Works</h2>
  <p>
    Users complete a 30–60 second daily check-in. AI analyzes trends over time
    and provides gentle, non-medical insights and early warnings.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Technology</h2>
  <p>
    Microsoft Azure OpenAI, Azure Cognitive Services, and Azure Machine Learning
    power PulseMind AI.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Ethics & Safety</h2>
  <p>
    PulseMind AI does not diagnose or prescribe treatment. It prioritizes
    transparency, user control, and emotional safety.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>
    View on GitHub:
    <a href="https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/pulsemind-ai" target="_blank">
      PulseMind AI Repository
    </a>
  </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
